{com}. 
. /********************************************************************
> Diagnostic: Does local social-group composition account for the
> comparison-group x private NNM interaction?
> 
> Console output only.
> 
> For each region and comparison group, this file estimates:
> 
>     (1) Baseline:
>         NNM = comparison group + private + group x private
>               + controls + district FE
> 
>     (2) + local higher-ranking share:
>         same model + higher-ranking share in the PSU
> 
> The coefficient of interest is:
>     1.comp_group#1.private
> 
> Definition of "higher ranking" requested:
> 
>     Adivasi comparison:
>         higher ranking = anyone who is NOT Adivasi or Dalit
>                        = OBC, Forward Hindu, Muslim
> 
>     Dalit comparison:
>         higher ranking = anyone who is NOT Adivasi or Dalit
>                        = OBC, Forward Hindu, Muslim
> 
>     OBC comparison:
>         higher ranking = Forward Hindu only
> 
>     Muslim comparison:
>         higher ranking = Forward Hindu only
> 
> IMPORTANT:
> - PSU social composition is constructed from ALL rural births in NFHS-4/5
>   belonging to the five analytic social groups, BEFORE restricting the
>   regression sample to public/private facility births.
> - This avoids defining "village caste composition" using facility choice.
> - The preferred composition control below is LEAVE-ONE-OUT: each birth's
>   own group is removed from the PSU composition measure.
> - The ordinary non-leave-one-out share is also reported as a sensitivity check.
> ********************************************************************/
. 
. 
. *------------------------------------------------------------
. * User settings
. *------------------------------------------------------------
. 
. local outcome nnm
{txt}
{com}. 
. local regions up_bihar non_upbihar_focus nonfocus
{txt}
{com}. 
. local groups 1 2 3 5
{txt}
{com}. 
. local groupname1 "Adivasi"
{txt}
{com}. local groupname2 "Dalit"
{txt}
{com}. local groupname3 "OBC"
{txt}
{com}. local groupname5 "Muslim"
{txt}
{com}. 
. local residence rural
{txt}
{com}. local r 4,5
{txt}
{com}. 
. local controls ///
>     i.prior ///
>     i.underweight_projected ///
>     i.male ///
>     i.momunder20 ///
>     i.multiples ///
>     i.v190 ///
>     i.birth_order ///
>     i.illiterate ///
>     i.round
{txt}
{com}. 
. 
